      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "The default value is [`invalid`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/CMTime/invalid), which indicates that the asset writer chooses an appropriate default value.",
      "ko": "By default, `AVCaptureStillImageOutput` emits images with the same dimensions as its source [`AVCaptureDevice`](avcapturedevice.md) instance’s `activeFormat.formatDescription`.",
      "sourceHash": "f7bd2731de3f06b561b08110da975e4d8ef4afc64e57ce0fdf75ee1a19567d8e",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "You may also set a positive numeric or [`indefinite`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/CMTime/indefinite) time.",
      "ko": "However, if you set this property to [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true), the receiver emits still images at the capture device’s [`highResolutionStillImageDimensions`](avcapturedevice/format/highresolutionstillimagedimensions.md) value.",
      "sourceHash": "a3b232d4081ab932217e41d2afcb8ad49b3b11bd695fda0e34d2287b83c7cfc0",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0003",
      "source": "When the value is [`indefinite`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/CMTime/indefinite), each call you make to [`flushSegment()`](avassetwriter/flushsegment().md) outputs a segment data.",
      "ko": "값이 [`indefinite`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/CMTime/indefinite)일 때 [`flushSegment()`](avassetwriter/flushsegment().md)를 호출하면 세그먼트 데이터가 출력됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "64bb4b9e96f4a681f1ab030e00991038aa66c0ae4a5ee5166c2d4236e03001f2",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "You can’t change this value after writing starts.",
      "ko": "이 값은 쓰기가 시작된 후에는 변경할 수 없습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "5d962273e943423188dd4c2f8697e30700b9fa199a729808f839845c1472966a",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
